+# Women apron layering — source candidate, not baked
+
+Owner observation: women's clothing also breaks through their aprons. Exact observed figure/year/LOD is unknown. Existing likely source paths are Mary Flynn's1835 adult dress; generic1904 Martha (Mattie) Williamson working-dress study; Mary Reynolds's1904 maid; Kate Ryan's1904 specialized cook. Their identities, grades, dates, references, body input, rig, clips, original reconstructed outlines/materials/ease and wardrobe provenance remain unchanged. No new personal likeness or historical garment claim is made.
+
+Source evidence: the lower apron already copied corresponding skirt vertices/weights, but added an unrelated1mm Y shift. The bib sampled the actual bodice onto a separate15x15grid and reconnected those points on its own diagonals, potentially bridging different support triangles. Linear skinning of interpolated positions/weights does not equal interpolation of an already-skinned support triangle. The canonical builder additionally decimates garment objects independently at each LOD. These are plausible mechanisms for posed breakthrough; they do not identify the user's exact visible intersection or establish its pose/asset cause.
+
+This candidate retains the lower apron's existing radial ease and actual skirt triangles/weights while removing its1mm longitudinal jog. The bib retains its existing trapezoid and depth ease but is clipped per actual bodice triangle. Both carry support triangle IDs and source barycentric bases. Original vertices preserve exact source weights; new bib boundary points retain the existing four-influence/2.5% discarded-mass contract. Physical1.5mm edge returns and UV/material conventions remain. Source body geometry is neither deleted nor padded, and no texture masks an intersection.
+
+Independent pose controls must consume actual emitted skinned triangle arrays for body vs skirt, skirt vs apron, bodice vs bib, and waist joins across a full native walk cycle, standing/turning and seated negative controls, all native LODs. Support receipts enable indexed witnesses. Boundary LBS interpolation and independent canonical decimation remain open; no universal posed support claim follows from this source change. The adversarial folded-support control catches an independent-grid diagonal entering its underlay, and a lower-panel control checks actual support Y/weights/faces. These controls are prepared but unrun while the1928 gate owns resources.
+
+Pending: ROOT/independent source review, admitted bounded source controls, canonical geometry bake through the existing pipeline (no Blender install/new exporter), full body/garment/LOD/native posed intersection proof, material/normal/UV checks, existing application gates and visible desktop/touch evidence. No asset, opt-in, delivery hash, frozen woven proof, runtime budget, APP commit/push or release flag has changed. No new ticket is created and T1789 remains open. This source-only candidate has not changed the published scene.
